{
  "lessonId": "L1M4L2",
  "title": "地域性配對原則",
  "content": "<div class='slides'><section class='slide-cover' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e74c3c 0%,#c0392b 100%)'><h1>🌍 地域性配對原則</h1><p class='subtitle'>What grows together, goes together</p></section><section class='slide'><h2>💡 地域性配對的核心理念</h2><div class='core-concept'><div class='concept-header'><h3>「一方水土養一方人酒」</h3><p class='subtitle-text'>當地的葡萄酒與當地料理經過數百年甚至上千年的共同演化，已經達到完美平衡。</p></div><div class='concept-grid'><div class='concept-card'><div class='concept-icon'>⏳</div><h4>時間驗證</h4><p>世代相傳的組合已被無數次驗證，不是偶然，是必然。</p></div><div class='concept-card'><div class='concept-icon'>🌱</div><h4>風土一致</h4><p>同一片土地孕育的葡萄與食材，有著相似的礦物質、氣候烙印。</p></div><div class='concept-card'><div class='concept-icon'>🧬</div><h4>文化基因</h4><p>釀酒師和廚師都在同一文化背景下創作，自然和諧。</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🗺️ 義大利五大區域配對</h2><div class='regional-overview'><div class='region-map-card north'><div class='region-label'>🏔️ 北部 (Piemonte, Veneto, Lombardy)</div><div class='region-features'><p><strong>氣候：</strong>大陸性、涼爽、四季分明</p><p><strong>料理特色：</strong>奶油、起司、燉菜、松露、玉米糊</p><p><strong>酒款特色：</strong>高酸度、優雅、結構感強</p></div></div><div class='region-map-card central'><div class='region-label'>🌻 中部 (Tuscany, Umbria, Marche)</div><div class='region-features'><p><strong>氣候：</strong>地中海、溫和、日照充足</p><p><strong>料理特色：</strong>橄欖油、番茄、烤肉、野味、豆類</p><p><strong>酒款特色：</strong>高酸高單寧、適合配紅肉</p></div></div><div class='region-map-card south'><div class='region-label'>☀️ 南部與島嶼 (Sicily, Sardinia, Puglia)</div><div class='region-features'><p><strong>氣候：</strong>炎熱、乾燥、海洋影響</p><p><strong>料理特色：</strong>海鮮、辛香料、橄欖油、蔬菜</p><p><strong>酒款特色：</strong>酒體飽滿、果香豐富、酒精度高</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍷 Piemonte 地域配對</h2><div class='regional-pairing'><div class='region-header piemonte-bg'><h3>🏔️ Piemonte 皮埃蒙特</h3><p>阿爾卑斯山麓的美食天堂</p></div><div class='pairing-details'><div class='food-section'><h4>🍽️ 代表料理</h4><ul><li><strong>Agnolotti del Plin</strong> - 肉餡小餃子</li><li><strong>Brasato al Barolo</strong> - Barolo 紅酒燉牛肉</li><li><strong>Tajarin al Tartufo</strong> - 白松露細麵</li><li><strong>Vitello Tonnato</strong> - 鮪魚醬小牛肉</li><li><strong>Bagna Cauda</strong> - 熱鯷魚蒜醬</li></ul></div><div class='wine-section'><h4>🍷 代表酒款</h4><ul><li><strong>Barolo DOCG</strong> - 力量型紅酒</li><li><strong>Barbaresco DOCG</strong> - 優雅型紅酒</li><li><strong>Barbera d'Alba</strong> - 日常紅酒</li><li><strong>Moscato d'Asti</strong> - 微甜氣泡</li><li><strong>Gavi</strong> - 清爽白酒</li></ul></div></div><div class='pairing-examples'><div class='pairing-match perfect'><div class='match-icon'>⭐</div><div class='match-content'><p><strong>經典組合：</strong>白松露燉飯 + Barolo</p><p class='match-reason'>土壤香與松露完美呼應，高單寧切割奶油的油膩</p></div></div><div class='pairing-match perfect'><div class='match-icon'>⭐</div><div class='match-content'><p><strong>經典組合：</strong>Vitello Tonnato + Gavi</p><p class='match-reason'>清爽白酒平衡鮪魚醬的鹹鮮，不壓過小牛肉</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍷 Tuscany 地域配對</h2><div class='regional-pairing'><div class='region-header tuscany-bg'><h3>🌻 Tuscany 托斯卡納</h3><p>橄欖油與 Sangiovese 的王國</p></div><div class='pairing-details'><div class='food-section'><h4>🍽️ 代表料理</h4><ul><li><strong>Bistecca alla Fiorentina</strong> - 佛羅倫斯 T 骨牛排</li><li><strong>Pappardelle al Cinghiale</strong> - 野豬肉寬麵</li><li><strong>Ribollita</strong> - 托斯卡納蔬菜湯</li><li><strong>Panzanella</strong> - 麵包番茄沙拉</li><li><strong>Lampredotto</strong> - 牛肚三明治</li></ul></div><div class='wine-section'><h4>🍷 代表酒款</h4><ul><li><strong>Brunello di Montalcino</strong></li><li><strong>Chianti Classico</strong></li><li><strong>Vino Nobile di Montepulciano</strong></li><li><strong>Super Tuscan</strong></li><li><strong>Vernaccia di San Gimignano</strong></li></ul></div></div><div class='pairing-examples'><div class='pairing-match perfect'><div class='match-icon'>⭐</div><div class='match-content'><p><strong>經典組合：</strong>Bistecca alla Fiorentina + Chianti Classico</p><p class='match-reason'>高酸高單寧的 Sangiovese 完美切割牛肉油脂</p></div></div><div class='pairing-match perfect'><div class='match-icon'>⭐</div><div class='match-content'><p><strong>經典組合：</strong>野豬肉醬麵 + Brunello di Montalcino</p><p class='match-reason'>野味需要濃郁酒體和複雜香料香氣來匹配</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍷 Veneto 地域配對</h2><div class='regional-pairing'><div class='region-header veneto-bg'><h3>🏛️ Veneto 威尼托</h3><p>從威尼斯潟湖到 Valpolicella 山丘</p></div><div class='pairing-details'><div class='food-section'><h4>🍽️ 代表料理</h4><ul><li><strong>Sarde in Saor</strong> - 醋漬沙丁魚</li><li><strong>Risotto al Nero di Seppia</strong> - 墨魚汁燉飯</li><li><strong>Fegato alla Veneziana</strong> - 威尼斯式肝臟</li><li><strong>Baccalà Mantecato</strong> - 鱈魚慕斯</li><li><strong>Polenta e Osei</strong> - 玉米糊配小鳥</li></ul></div><div class='wine-section'><h4>🍷 代表酒款</h4><ul><li><strong>Prosecco</strong></li><li><strong>Soave Classico</strong></li><li><strong>Amarone della Valpolicella</strong></li><li><strong>Valpolicella Ripasso</strong></li><li><strong>Lugana</strong></li></ul></div></div><div class='pairing-examples'><div class='pairing-match perfect'><div class='match-icon'>⭐</div><div class='match-content'><p><strong>經典組合：</strong>Sarde in Saor + Prosecco</p><p class='match-reason'>氣泡酒的清爽切割醋漬的酸度，不互相競爭</p></div></div><div class='pairing-match perfect'><div class='match-icon'>⭐</div><div class='match-content'><p><strong>經典組合：</strong>燉野味 + Amarone</p><p class='match-reason'>濃郁甜美的 Amarone 匹配野味的強烈風味</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍷 Sicily 地域配對</h2><div class='regional-pairing'><div class='region-header sicily-bg'><h3>🌋 Sicily 西西里</h3><p>地中海陽光與火山土壤</p></div><div class='pairing-details'><div class='food-section'><h4>🍽️ 代表料理</h4><ul><li><strong>Arancini</strong> - 炸飯糰</li><li><strong>Pasta alla Norma</strong> - 茄子番茄麵</li><li><strong>Caponata</strong> - 茄汁燉蔬菜</li><li><strong>Pesce Spada</strong> - 劍魚排</li><li><strong>Involtini di Pesce Spada</strong> - 劍魚捲</li></ul></div><div class='wine-section'><h4>🍷 代表酒款</h4><ul><li><strong>Nero d'Avola</strong></li><li><strong>Etna Rosso</strong></li><li><strong>Grillo</strong></li><li><strong>Cerasuolo di Vittoria</strong></li><li><strong>Marsala</strong></li></ul></div></div><div class='pairing-examples'><div class='pairing-match perfect'><div class='match-icon'>⭐</div><div class='match-content'><p><strong>經典組合：</strong>Pasta alla Norma + Nero d'Avola</p><p class='match-reason'>當地番茄茄子與當地濃郁紅酒，茄香與果香呼應</p></div></div><div class='pairing-match perfect'><div class='match-icon'>⭐</div><div class='match-content'><p><strong>經典組合：</strong>烤劍魚 + Grillo</p><p class='match-reason'>地中海白酒的檸檬香與劍魚的鮮甜完美平衡</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>📋 地域配對實戰檢查表</h2><div class='checklist'><div class='check-item'><div class='check-icon'>✓</div><div class='check-text'><strong>Step 1:</strong> 確認料理來自哪個產區</div></div><div class='check-item'><div class='check-icon'>✓</div><div class='check-text'><strong>Step 2:</strong> 選擇同產區的葡萄酒（首選）</div></div><div class='check-item'><div class='check-icon'>✓</div><div class='check-text'><strong>Step 3:</strong> 如無同產區酒，選擇氣候相似產區</div></div><div class='check-item'><div class='check-icon'>✓</div><div class='check-text'><strong>Step 4:</strong> 驗證重量匹配（輕配輕、重配重）</div></div><div class='check-item'><div class='check-icon'>✓</div><div class='check-text'><strong>Step 5:</strong> 檢查酸度是否足夠（番茄、醋等）</div></div><div class='check-item'><div class='check-icon'>✓</div><div class='check-text'><strong>Step 6:</strong> 確認單寧/酸度能否切割油脂</div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🎓 重點回顧</h2><div class='key-points'><div class='point'>✓ 地域配對是義大利配餐的核心原則</div><div class='point'>✓ 當地酒配當地菜經過數百年驗證，不是偶然</div><div class='point'>✓ 北部：奶油料理配高酸度酒（Barolo + 松露）</div><div class='point'>✓ 中部：番茄料理配高酸高單寧酒（Chianti + 牛排）</div><div class='point'>✓ 南部：海鮮與辛香料配果香豐富酒（Nero d'Avola + 茄子）</div><div class='point'>✓ 實戰時先找同產區酒，再驗證重量和酸度</div></div></section></div><style>.core-concept{background:#fff;padding:35px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.concept-header{text-align:center;margin-bottom:30px;padding-bottom:25px;border-bottom:3px solid #e74c3c}.concept-header h3{margin:0 0 15px;color:#e74c3c;font-size:1.8rem}.subtitle-text{margin:0;color:#555;line-height:1.8;font-size:1.1rem}.concept-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.concept-card{text-align:center;padding:25px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fadbd8,#fff);border-radius:12px;border-top:5px solid #e74c3c}.concept-icon{font-size:3rem;margin-bottom:15px}.concept-card h4{margin:10px 0;color:#c0392b;font-size:1.2rem}.concept-card p{margin:0;color:#555;line-height:1.6}.regional-overview{display:grid;gap:20px}.region-map-card{padding:25px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}.region-map-card.north{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d5e8f7,#fff);border-left:6px solid #3498db}.region-map-card.central{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fef5e7,#fff);border-left:6px solid #f39c12}.region-map-card.south{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fef3e0,#fff);border-left:6px solid #e67e22}.region-label{font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:700;color:#2c3e50;margin-bottom:15px}.region-features{display:grid;gap:10px}.region-features p{margin:0;padding:10px 15px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.7);border-radius:8px;line-height:1.6}.region-features strong{color:#2c3e50}.regional-pairing{background:#fff;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1);margin:20px 0}.region-header{padding:25px;color:#fff;text-align:center}.piemonte-bg{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8e44ad,#9b59b6)}.tuscany-bg{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d35400,#e67e22)}.veneto-bg{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#16a085,#1abc9c)}.sicily-bg{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e67e22,#f39c12)}.region-header h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:1.6rem}.region-header p{margin:0;font-size:1.1rem;opacity:.95}.pairing-details{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:25px;padding:25px}.food-section,.wine-section{background:#f8f9fa;padding:20px;border-radius:10px}.food-section h4,.wine-section h4{margin:0 0 15px;color:#e74c3c;font-size:1.2rem;border-bottom:2px solid #ecf0f1;padding-bottom:10px}.food-section ul,.wine-section ul{margin:0;padding-left:20px;line-height:2.2}.food-section li,.wine-section li{color:#2c3e50}.pairing-examples{padding:0 25px 25px;display:grid;gap:15px}.pairing-match{display:flex;gap:15px;align-items:center;padding:18px;border-radius:10px}.pairing-match.perfect{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#d5f4e6,transparent);border-left:5px solid #27ae60}.match-icon{font-size:2rem}.match-content p{margin:5px 0;line-height:1.6}.match-content strong{color:#27ae60}.match-reason{font-size:.95rem;color:#555;font-style:italic}.checklist{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.1);display:grid;gap:15px}.check-item{display:flex;gap:15px;align-items:center;padding:18px 25px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fadbd8,transparent);border-radius:10px;border-left:5px solid #e74c3c}.check-icon{font-size:1.8rem;color:#27ae60;font-weight:700}.check-text{color:#2c3e50;font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.6}.check-text strong{color:#e74c3c}.key-points{display:grid;gap:10px}.point{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fadbd8,transparent);padding:16px 22px;border-left:4px solid #e74c3c;font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;color:#2c3e50}</style>",
  "quiz": [
